turntable-home = Back to zero
turntable-cal-title = Calibration
turntable-cal-hint = Put a still object with some shape on the platter (a typodont, or a crumpled ball of paper) and connect the scanner. The turntable stops 24 times, 15° apart, and the scanner takes 3 frames at each stop; from then on the scan keeps only what stands on the platter.
