scan-auto-rotation = Turn at each tilt
scan-auto-mode-continuous = Turning
scan-auto-mode-stop = Stop and capture
scan-auto-stop-step = Angle between the stops
scan-auto-stop-frames = Frames at each stop
scan-auto-stop-hint = The turntable stops at each angle and the scanner takes the frames at rest, so they are not smeared. Slower, but steadier.
scan-warn-scan-quality-weak = Some views were registered weakly. Check the result before you use it, and calibrate again if it looks smeared.
scan-warn-other = The scan is usable but weak: check it before you use it.
scan-quality-title = Result of the last automatic scan
scan-quality-stops = { $fused } of { $stops } stops fused, { $flagged } placed from the turntable angle only.
scan-quality-frames = { $fused } of { $frames } frames fused.
scan-quality-residual = Mean distance between views: { $mm } mm.
scan-quality-loop = Error at the end of the full turn: { $deg }°.
scan-auto-uncalibrated-hint = Without a calibration the turntable turns without stopping. Calibrate for the steadier stop and capture scan.
scan-auto-start = Start the automatic scan
scan-auto-hint = At each tilt the turntable turns; when it is calibrated it stops at every step so the scanner takes the frames at rest. Pause and Stop above also stop the turntable.
scan-auto-progress = Move { $step } of { $steps }, tilted { $tilt }°
scan-auto-confirm-title = Scan without calibrating?
scan-auto-confirm-body = The turntable is not calibrated with this scanner. Calibrate first: without it, what stands still around the turntable is scanned too and can smear the scan while the platter turns.
scan-auto-confirm-calibrate = Calibrate first
scan-auto-confirm-anyway = Scan anyway
scan-err-unknown-backend = This kind of scanner is not supported.
scan-err-device-not-found = The scanner is not connected any more: look for scanners again.
scan-err-device = The scanner stopped answering. Check its cable, then connect it again.
scan-err-not-connected = Connect a scanner first.
scan-err-invalid-state = Not possible at this point of the scan.
scan-err-invalid-params = A value is out of its range.
scan-err-empty = There is nothing to work on yet.
scan-err-cancelled = Stopped.
scan-err-geometry = The computation could not finish on this scan.
scan-err-mesh = The scan file could not be read or written.
scan-err-no-mesh = Build the surface first.
scan-err-busy = Another operation is still running on the case: try again when it ends.
scan-err-import = The scan could not be imported into the case.
scan-err-sdk-missing = The Revopoint SDK is not installed: put its library (lib3DCamera.so or 3DCamera.dll) in the dentalcraft/revopoint-sdk folder of your user data folder, or set DC_REVOPOINT_SDK to its path.
scan-err-sdk-unauthorized = This scanner is not authorised for the Revopoint SDK: ask Revopoint (customer@revopoint3d.com) to authorise its serial number.
scan-err-platform-unsupported = This kind of scanner connection does not work on this operating system.
scan-err-device-lost = The scanner was disconnected. Check its cable, then start again.
scan-err-turntable-not-connected = Connect the turntable first.
scan-err-turntable-out-of-range = The turntable cannot reach this angle.
scan-err-turntable-busy = The turntable is still moving: wait for it, or press Stop the turntable.
scan-err-turntable-protocol = The turntable answered something unexpected. Switch it off and on, then connect it again.
scan-err-ble-no-adapter = This computer has no Bluetooth: add a Bluetooth adapter (a USB dongle works) to use the turntable.
scan-err-ble-adapter-off = Bluetooth is off: switch it on in the settings of the computer.
scan-err-ble-unsupported = Bluetooth turntables do not work on this operating system yet.
scan-err-ble-not-found = The turntable was not found: check that it is on and near the computer, and that no other app (such as Revo Scan) is connected to it.
scan-err-ble-timeout = The turntable did not answer in time. Move it closer to the computer and try again.
scan-err-ble-disconnected = The turntable was disconnected. Check its power, then connect it again.
scan-err-ble-platform = Bluetooth reported an error. Try again; switching Bluetooth off and on often helps.
scan-err-rig-uncalibrated = The turntable is not calibrated with this scanner: calibrate it first, or confirm to scan anyway.
scan-err-calibration = The calibration could not be computed from this run: try again with a still object with some shape.
scan-err-calibration-no-object = No object was found on the platter. Put a still object with some shape on it and keep the rest of the platter clear.
scan-err-calibration-tracking = The scanner lost the object while the platter turned. Use a matte object with some shape, keep it about 20 cm from the scanner and try again.
scan-err-calibration-inaccurate = The measured axis is too uncertain to use. Fix the object so it cannot slip and calibrate again.
scan-err-calibration-implausible = The measured axis is not where the platter can be. Check that the scanner looks down at the platter and calibrate again.
scan-err-scan-quality-low = Too few views were registered to trust this scan. Check the calibration and the object, then scan again.
scan-err-other = The scan action did not finish.
